<section class="sv-about-block"><div class="sv-wrap sv-about-block__grid"><div class="sv-about-block__copy"><p class="sv-eyebrow">WE LIVE FOR THE IN-BETWEEN</p><h2>THE LONG<br>WAY <em>home.</em></h2><p>NORTHLINE is a concept snowboard and outdoor goods label built around one idea: the best moments aren't always on the map.</p><p>We believe the thrill of movement deserves a brand that feels just as alive as the people who make it happen. We create a visual world for the curious, the restless, and the ones who take the scenic route.</p><a class="sv-pill sv-pill--dark" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">EXPLORE THE EDIT <span>&nearr;</span></a></div><div class="sv-about-block__art"><div class="sv-about-block__art-header">NORTHLINE / FIELD TEST 002</div>{% if item.featured_image %}{{ item.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: item.title }}{% else %}<img src="{{ 'strata-board.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Snowboard illustration" width="400" height="700">{% endif %}<div class="sv-about-block__art-footer">KEEP YOUR HEAD UP, KEEP MOVING.</div></div></div></section>
<section class="sv-values"><div class="sv-wrap"><p class="sv-eyebrow">A FEW THINGS WE BELIEVE IN</p><div class="sv-values__grid"><div><span>01 /</span><h3>FEEL<br>MORE.</h3><p>Experiences beat expectations. Always.</p></div><div><span>02 /</span><h3>MOVE<br>FREELY.</h3><p>The best line is the one you draw yourself.</p></div><div><span>03 /</span><h3>STAY<br>CURIOUS.</h3><p>Keep turning corners. Keep discovering.</p></div></div></div></section>
